\vspace{0.5cm}

\noindent \textbf{Phase Mapping:}
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Phase I (Ingest \& Geometry):} CPU + system RAM, writes lattice and defect tensors into HBM/VRAM.
    \item \textbf{Phase II (Quantum Solver Engine):} GPU kernels on Hamiltonian, eigenvalues, and topological invariants.
    \item \textbf{Phase III (Information Dynamics):} GPU/CPU hybrid, operating on large information fields in HBM.
    \item \textbf{Phase IV (Lindblad \& Visualization):} GPU for $\rho(t)$ evolution, CPU for aggregation and output to storage.
\end{itemize}

